WEBVTT

00:02.860 --> 00:04.770
Nice to meet you.

00:05.950 --> 00:08.050
Nice to meet you.

00:08.050 --> 00:10.790
Cecil, what are you doing?

00:10.790 --> 00:13.030
I'm practicing introducing myself.

00:13.030 --> 00:16.120
Today is the first time
we'll have a proper conversation.

00:16.120 --> 00:19.540
You're meeting your duet project
partner after this, right?

00:19.540 --> 00:22.580
Yes. I wonder what he's like.

00:22.580 --> 00:23.910
Good luck.

00:23.910 --> 00:26.380
Cecil-san, shall we go?

00:26.380 --> 00:27.330
Yes.

00:31.820 --> 00:36.110
I'm excited to sing with Amakusa Shion.

02:19.490 --> 02:21.010
He's late.

02:21.010 --> 02:23.910
Yes, but it's fine.

02:23.910 --> 02:25.780
The music's not going anywhere.

02:25.780 --> 02:29.110
Maybe one of his other jobs is running late.

02:29.110 --> 02:30.230
Let's wait for him.

02:35.690 --> 02:36.350
Huh?

02:40.120 --> 02:41.170
Shion!

02:42.700 --> 02:47.310
I've been waiting for you, my partner
who will sing Haruka's song with me.

02:48.990 --> 02:50.980
I am Aijima Cecil.

02:50.980 --> 02:53.060
It's nice to meet you.

02:53.060 --> 02:56.900
I'm Nanami Haruka,
and I'll be composing the song.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.810
Um...

03:05.810 --> 03:08.140
Let's discuss the song.

03:08.140 --> 03:12.330
Y-Yes, let's. Amakusa-san,
do you have any ideas?

03:15.230 --> 03:17.470
Um... S-Shion-san?

03:17.940 --> 03:19.920
This is a great opportunity.

03:19.920 --> 03:23.760
I'd like to sing about our world. Yours and mine.

03:23.760 --> 03:25.180
Your world?

03:26.110 --> 03:29.390
But we've only just met.

03:29.390 --> 03:31.350
Let's work on finding it.

03:32.440 --> 03:38.610
Unable to see the end of the road,
we're forced to wander in the darkness.

03:38.610 --> 03:39.350
What?

03:39.350 --> 03:40.950
Those are wonderful lyrics.

03:43.700 --> 03:48.080
The overwhelming, cheerful energy disrupts the Amakusa grass.

03:48.080 --> 03:51.120
I'm sure lots of people
would want to listen to that song.

03:52.780 --> 03:55.690
My words aren't even getting through.

03:55.690 --> 03:59.300
You're right. It may not be necessary
to express ourselves with words.

03:59.800 --> 04:04.680
Let's use other methods to find our song.

04:09.170 --> 04:12.060
Cecil-kun and Haru-chan, welcome back.

04:12.060 --> 04:13.840
We're back.

04:13.840 --> 04:14.600
How did it go?

04:14.600 --> 04:18.430
Shion and I are on the same wavelength.

04:18.430 --> 04:20.170
Our feelings are perfectly in sync.

04:20.860 --> 04:23.190
What was he like?

04:23.190 --> 04:28.910
He doesn't say much,
but I felt he had a clear image.

04:28.910 --> 04:33.210
He's taking this project very seriously.

04:33.210 --> 04:35.390
I'm glad it went well.

04:35.390 --> 04:39.510
I'm looking forward to hearing
the song you'll come up with.

04:39.510 --> 04:41.880
Show 'em how you feel.

04:42.200 --> 04:44.260
Don't worry about me.

04:44.260 --> 04:46.180
Sounds promising.

04:50.330 --> 04:50.970
Well?

04:51.370 --> 04:54.020
Are you worried about something, my lady?

04:54.020 --> 04:54.620
What?

04:55.630 --> 04:57.170
Nanami, is something wrong?

04:57.890 --> 05:05.310
I still don't know how
Amakusa-san feels about the project.

05:05.910 --> 05:11.950
And I couldn't really understand
what they were talking about.

05:14.290 --> 05:17.100
W-Well, you only just started.

05:17.100 --> 05:19.670
There's still a long way to go. You'll be fine.

05:20.010 --> 05:22.940
You're right. Thank you.

05:28.300 --> 05:33.990
I'd like to get even closer to Shion
by the time we sing together.

05:35.430 --> 05:38.650
Why don't we start with our voices?

05:39.070 --> 05:40.890
You mean a cappella?

05:40.890 --> 05:44.340
It would be good to start
with a style that suits you.

05:44.340 --> 05:46.900
Exactly. Shion, what do you think?

05:48.890 --> 05:49.900
Shion?

05:51.340 --> 05:53.580
I'll let you handle it.

05:53.580 --> 05:56.120
Are you having trouble coming up with ideas?

06:00.390 --> 06:03.170
Why don't we try singing?

06:04.710 --> 06:08.460
It will be easier to come up with ideas this way.

06:09.700 --> 06:12.100
Fine, then.

06:13.380 --> 06:17.190
I know. Let's try moving next.

06:19.370 --> 06:23.000
Let's move together, so we can
share the same sensations.

06:28.370 --> 06:30.070
Here. Use this.

06:32.540 --> 06:34.280
I have my own.

06:35.320 --> 06:37.160
I see.

06:48.170 --> 06:49.760
Would you like to eat together?

06:50.950 --> 06:53.250
I'm on a strict diet.

06:59.940 --> 07:03.730
Shion doesn't seem to be enjoying himself.

07:06.060 --> 07:08.780
I'll do my best to write a song for you two.

07:09.780 --> 07:12.310
Let's do our best again tomorrow.

07:12.310 --> 07:12.870
Yes.

07:23.570 --> 07:27.470
You seem exhausted.
Is the duet project coming along well?

07:28.790 --> 07:30.130
He's so...

07:32.030 --> 07:37.310
Everything is going fine.
There's nothing for you to worry about, Eiichi.

07:38.660 --> 07:40.330
That's fine, then.

07:41.270 --> 07:43.470
It is a fun project.

07:43.950 --> 07:46.230
Don't you mean a pain in the butt?

07:47.270 --> 07:49.530
If it will help HEAVENS...

07:50.120 --> 07:53.740
Otori Eiichi-san, Amakusa-san,
you're on next.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.170
Okay, good.

08:02.920 --> 08:06.220
I'm tired. Carry me.

08:06.220 --> 08:07.500
Hey!

08:07.500 --> 08:09.340
You're too heavy, Shion!

08:13.720 --> 08:17.780
Nagi, you have the warmth of a child.

08:18.490 --> 08:20.840
It's so comfy.

08:20.840 --> 08:24.240
Stop watching and help me.

08:24.240 --> 08:27.780
Isn't this a good opportunity
to build some muscle?

08:27.780 --> 08:30.750
I'm the cute one. I'm fine the way I am.

08:30.750 --> 08:34.910
Good. This combination is truly HEAVENS.

08:34.910 --> 08:39.740
Eiichi gave us permission.
You shall carry me.

08:39.740 --> 08:41.540
That doesn't make any sense.

08:41.540 --> 08:44.790
Eiji, Yamato, help!

08:53.950 --> 08:56.430
Cecil-san, is something wrong?

08:57.300 --> 09:01.350
Shion was smiling when he was with HEAVENS.

09:01.350 --> 09:02.430
Smiling?

09:04.090 --> 09:07.180
He was different from when he's with me.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.900
Shion...

09:20.090 --> 09:23.470
Are you not having fun right now?

09:24.700 --> 09:27.580
HEAVENS and STARISH are rivals.

09:28.060 --> 09:33.840
But haven't the muses led us
to sing together as partners?

09:34.450 --> 09:35.550
Partners?

09:35.550 --> 09:39.900
Yes. I'd like to enjoy Haruka's song.

09:39.900 --> 09:41.080
With you—

09:41.080 --> 09:41.760
Don't touch me!

09:43.050 --> 09:45.470
I don't need anything besides HEAVENS.

09:46.180 --> 09:48.930
I swore I would only sing with HEAVENS.

09:49.610 --> 09:53.230
If I break my oath, my soul will be defiled!

09:53.230 --> 09:58.910
Is that why you don't smile
when you're around us?

09:59.250 --> 10:02.440
Music brings people's hearts together.

10:02.440 --> 10:03.360
Your soul won't be—

10:03.360 --> 10:04.290
Quiet!

10:04.290 --> 10:07.330
I put up with this because
I thought it would benefit HEAVENS,

10:07.330 --> 10:09.030
but I can't take it anymore.

10:09.030 --> 10:11.290
I refuse to sing with you!

10:27.680 --> 10:29.250
What's going on?

10:29.250 --> 10:31.290
Was that Shion?

10:31.880 --> 10:32.860
What's wrong?

10:41.820 --> 10:43.160
He's refusing to sing the duet?

10:44.490 --> 10:47.080
Wh-Where did that come from?

10:47.080 --> 10:51.750
This is a joint project between
the Shining agency and the Raging agency.

10:52.200 --> 10:56.220
I can't imagine it could be scrapped that easily.

11:00.460 --> 11:02.510
We found you, STARISH.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.760
HEAVENS?

11:03.760 --> 11:07.500
It seems you really did a number on our Shion.

11:07.500 --> 11:10.190
What did you do to him?

11:10.190 --> 11:12.590
How are you going to make up for this?

11:12.590 --> 11:14.440
Guys, calm down.

11:14.630 --> 11:17.190
Y-You can't come barging in here!

11:17.530 --> 11:20.320
Well? What on earth did you do to Shion?

11:20.320 --> 11:22.520
We could ask you the same thing.

11:22.520 --> 11:26.580
What? But Shion locked himself in the closet.

11:27.290 --> 11:31.960
He won't even talk about it,
which is why we're here.

11:32.280 --> 11:34.380
So you stormed our dorm.

11:34.690 --> 11:39.540
I know that's how it ended up,
but we're just worried about Shion.

11:39.540 --> 11:41.730
I don't have time for this.

11:41.730 --> 11:43.550
Let me ask them with my fists.

11:43.550 --> 11:44.760
You want to fight?

11:44.760 --> 11:45.930
The Triple S.

11:47.320 --> 11:50.770
The duet project is meant
to brush up our skills for the Triple S.

11:51.690 --> 11:52.890
We must do it.

11:53.410 --> 11:58.900
If we can't complete this project,
both groups may become unable to participate.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.400
I don't want that.

12:01.400 --> 12:05.490
Then we shouldn't be fighting.

12:05.490 --> 12:08.890
First, we need to do something
about the guy locked in the closet.

12:08.890 --> 12:13.210
Yeah, but do you think he'll be able
to sing after being dragged out of it?

12:13.520 --> 12:17.170
It'll be difficult unless we
understand how Shion-kun feels.

12:17.170 --> 12:21.970
You're the one who caused
Shion great emotional pain, right?

12:22.390 --> 12:23.770
Do you have any idea what caused it?

12:25.330 --> 12:30.690
Shion said he swore to only sing with HEAVENS.

12:31.160 --> 12:34.350
He said doing otherwise would defile his soul.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.020
Shion said that?

12:37.500 --> 12:40.350
He doesn't need to worry about that.

12:40.350 --> 12:42.190
Shion is delicate.

12:42.190 --> 12:46.530
Well, Shion does care about
HEAVENS more than anyone else.

12:46.530 --> 12:50.950
He was the last one to join HEAVENS.

12:50.950 --> 12:52.120
Shion was?

12:52.120 --> 12:58.100
Yeah. At first, he always had his guard up,
but now he fits right in.

12:58.100 --> 13:00.620
He must be really comfortable around us.

13:00.620 --> 13:05.410
But on the flip side, he fears losing
HEAVENS more than anything else.

13:16.200 --> 13:17.110
Camus.

13:18.310 --> 13:20.860
I thought you were on tour.

13:20.860 --> 13:25.250
You fool! Of course I'm not gone
for the entire duration of the tour.

13:26.100 --> 13:28.360
Th-Then what are you doing here?

13:28.360 --> 13:30.490
I came to get some of my things.

13:35.020 --> 13:37.510
I need to talk to you.

13:40.670 --> 13:45.260
Your duet partner is refusing to sing? Pathetic.

13:45.260 --> 13:46.420
I know.

13:46.420 --> 13:47.800
Why are you asking me about it?

13:48.790 --> 13:53.330
This is an important job for STARISH.

13:53.780 --> 13:56.130
I wanted to overcome this with my own strength.

13:56.540 --> 14:02.190
But I don't know what to do.

14:04.610 --> 14:06.740
Let's suppose I joined STARISH.

14:09.320 --> 14:11.320
Where did that come from?

14:12.440 --> 14:16.830
Did you feel as though
I had intruded on your space?

14:16.830 --> 14:17.460
What?

14:17.900 --> 14:22.430
Trampling all over another's space
and intrusively entering their territory.

14:23.610 --> 14:26.840
I simply described the same thing you're doing.

14:27.990 --> 14:29.060
His space...

14:29.940 --> 14:32.470
I don't need anything besides HEAVENS.

14:32.790 --> 14:35.180
He must be really comfortable around us.

14:36.760 --> 14:39.110
Shion's space...

14:40.910 --> 14:41.930
Camus.

14:41.930 --> 14:42.900
What?

14:42.900 --> 14:44.740
Thank you.

14:55.340 --> 14:56.610
Cecil-san.

14:57.140 --> 14:59.290
I'm going to see Shion.

14:59.690 --> 15:02.570
I understand how he feels now.

15:02.570 --> 15:05.750
We feel very similarly.

15:12.260 --> 15:14.010
This is your song.

15:16.790 --> 15:19.180
Thank you, my princess.

15:21.070 --> 15:24.860
I promise we'll sing this song together.

15:29.370 --> 15:34.470
At this rate, we won't be able
to appear in the Triple S concert.

15:34.470 --> 15:36.040
What are you going to do about it?

15:36.820 --> 15:39.120
I'll break down the door
and drag him out of there.

15:39.120 --> 15:40.250
Don't, Yamato.

15:40.250 --> 15:42.750
What? Why not?

15:45.090 --> 15:52.930
Shion, if you're determined to keep
your oath, then I won't stop you.

15:54.070 --> 15:55.920
I'll take responsibility for this.

15:55.920 --> 16:00.600
Yeah, but it'll definitely
hurt HEAVENS' reputation.

16:00.600 --> 16:01.480
No!

16:01.910 --> 16:05.650
HEAVENS must not be hurt!

16:07.260 --> 16:10.070
It's your decision, Shion.

16:11.810 --> 16:13.660
Because of me...

16:14.710 --> 16:16.280
Hey, Shion.

16:16.750 --> 16:20.370
Do you think I've been defiled because
I've sung with someone outside of HEAVENS?

16:20.370 --> 16:24.630
No! My oath only applies to me.

16:24.630 --> 16:26.980
It's my own problem!

16:29.450 --> 16:30.510
Shion!

16:32.380 --> 16:33.220
Brother.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.590
Shion!

16:43.160 --> 16:44.570
Wait.

16:51.610 --> 16:54.610
I know. It's for HEAVENS.

16:54.610 --> 16:55.410
But...

16:55.800 --> 16:58.320
Shion, I'm sorry.

16:58.320 --> 17:01.160
I wasn't trying to understand you.

17:01.720 --> 17:04.830
You came all the way here just to say that?

17:06.600 --> 17:09.040
But now it's different.

17:09.040 --> 17:14.630
I understand your desire
to protect and preserve your space.

17:18.470 --> 17:21.390
How could you understand?

17:23.770 --> 17:25.000
I do understand.

17:25.970 --> 17:28.650
Because STARISH is where I belong.

17:29.420 --> 17:32.510
Words are cheap.

17:33.080 --> 17:35.450
I'm like you.

17:36.710 --> 17:39.870
I was the last one to join STARISH, too.

17:41.180 --> 17:48.830
When I imagined I might be blocking their
brilliance or becoming a hindrance,

17:49.960 --> 17:51.500
I was scared.

17:52.210 --> 17:55.670
I was alone. I didn't understand anything.

17:56.020 --> 17:57.760
The joy of singing together.

17:57.760 --> 18:00.760
Having warm friends who accept you.

18:01.100 --> 18:05.140
Aiming for greater heights together
and supporting one another.

18:05.140 --> 18:08.810
The occasional fight that happens
because everyone is so earnest.

18:09.650 --> 18:16.070
And the way we touch people
and the love we receive.

18:18.530 --> 18:23.140
They're all things STARISH taught me.

18:23.930 --> 18:29.040
That's why I want to give back
all this love and gratitude.

18:32.370 --> 18:34.530
STARISH is a constellation.

18:35.010 --> 18:38.500
I thought I was a lone star among
a sea of stars shining in the sky,

18:39.300 --> 18:47.110
but there were so many brilliant stars
who would stand beside me.

18:50.740 --> 18:55.560
Shion, you're one of the stars shining
in the constellation that is HEAVENS.

18:56.200 --> 18:58.420
The constellation that is HEAVENS...

18:59.030 --> 19:03.570
And we are stars shining in the same sky.

19:07.320 --> 19:09.780
Sing for HEAVENS.

19:10.860 --> 19:14.630
What do you sing for?

19:15.740 --> 19:18.970
I'll sing for STARISH.

19:20.590 --> 19:23.680
So we sing together, for different things?

19:24.650 --> 19:27.640
I'll wait for you to come.

20:19.280 --> 20:26.370
Twinkle, twinkle stars

20:26.370 --> 20:33.500
Flickering on a quiet night

20:33.970 --> 20:39.840
Twinkle, twinkle they seem to cry

20:39.840 --> 20:48.550
The voices pouring from them sound like sad sighs

20:47.180 --> 20:51.900
Searching for where we belong

20:50.890 --> 20:55.770
We wander tonight

20:55.770 --> 20:57.770
Gazes directed at our feet

20:57.770 --> 20:59.360
Raise our heads instead

20:59.360 --> 21:01.820
The realization will make us shine

21:01.820 --> 21:07.660
Look out and you'll see seven stars

21:07.660 --> 21:13.500
Bridge the heavens and
you'll find them together

21:13.500 --> 21:16.330
Lights written in the night sky

21:16.330 --> 21:22.370
We can hear the voices
telling us we're not alone

21:22.370 --> 21:27.640
Embrace the bonds connecting
us to others in our hearts

21:27.640 --> 21:31.020
And it will appear

21:31.020 --> 21:36.490
Visible Elf

21:46.030 --> 21:49.560
This is the world outside of HEAVENS.

21:50.620 --> 21:53.410
This is what it means
to sing in the same sky.

21:53.410 --> 21:58.460
Yes. We shone amongst
our respective constellations.

21:59.370 --> 22:01.610
I sang as part of HEAVENS.

22:02.120 --> 22:04.420
And I sang as a member of STARISH.

22:05.340 --> 22:09.950
I have accepted your brilliance
with all of my senses.

22:10.650 --> 22:14.680
I never thought I could sing
for HEAVENS in this way.

22:14.680 --> 22:17.890
I agree. Let's sing together again.

22:18.860 --> 22:20.250
Well done, Shion!

22:20.760 --> 22:22.230
You worked hard!

22:22.740 --> 22:24.070
Great job.

22:24.850 --> 22:26.110
You did a good job, Shion.

24:06.000 --> 24:08.090
I will sing for you.

24:08.090 --> 24:09.680
With all my heart.

24:09.680 --> 24:11.010
Uta Pri.
